{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1788173203171,"sessionID":"ses_fa8934456ffeMwhVt4xNG16hV3","part":{"id":"prt_0576db6dd001HM5jYEexFJCmNH","messageID":"msg_0576db2e2001ibq30Lhd0WMeWD","sessionID":"ses_fa8934456ffeMwhVt4xNG16hV3","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1788173204966,"sessionID":"ses_fa8934456ffeMwhVt4xNG16hV3","part":{"id":"prt_0576db976001f2oRBsH7pW72go","messageID":"msg_0576db2e2001ibq30Lhd0WMeWD","sessionID":"ses_fa8934456ffeMwhVt4xNG16hV3","type":"text","text":"The implementation-level assertions now pass, including stable repeated ordering and exact injected jitter timing. Since pytest is unavailable in the environment, I also ran all three test functions directly and compiled the package successfully; I’m documenting both the fix and that environment limitation in `root_cause.md`.","time":{"start":1788173203830,"end":1788173204959},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0ebe807b6ea41335016a955b93c6b487d296be313770a2f7c4","phase":"commentary"}}}}
